{"id":"d84df7f701355c56","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md","title":"KF 与 VF 的算术强度不同","display":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — KF 与 VF 的算术强度不同","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","aliases":["91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","91-thm-VF-KF-equiv"],"display":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — KF 与 VF 的算术强度不同","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-ramified-truth]]","[[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence</span><span>91-thm-VF-KF-equiv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — KF 与 VF 的算术强度不同"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a804bf41cb20efd\" href=\"?note=7a804bf41cb20efd\" title=\"91-df-positive-inductive-definition\">91-df-positive-inductive-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 均为原书全归纳经典系统；比较类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 使用已补建的标准定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为算术后果比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>KF 的层级下界由 Theorem 15.25 的真理定义得到，上界由原书 §15.3 的归约给出。原书 第 17 章末 区分任意正固定点与最小正固定点的强度；第 18 章 转述 VF 达到 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span> 的分析，严格超过 KF。\n这里不是全部真理语言公式的直接包含，也不是根据同一证明论序数作未经证明的逐句等价推断。文件名保留 equivalence 以兼容入链，但正确结论是否定等强。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.25 及 §15.3 末，印刷页 209–210；第 17 章末、第 18 章，印刷页 248、251。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved",